---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';

const updated = 'July 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Lawrence Law Property collects, uses and protects your personal data, in line with Malaysia's Personal Data Protection Act 2010 (PDPA)."
>
  <section class="section-pad">
    <div class="container-site max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="label-sm mt-3 text-ink/50">Last updated: {updated}</p>
      <div class="gold-rule mt-4"></div>

      <div class="prose-zh">
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>Lawrence Law Property™</strong> (“we”, “our” or
          “I”) collects, uses and protects your personal data when you use this website or contact
          us, in accordance with the <strong>Personal Data Protection Act 2010 (PDPA)</strong> of
          Malaysia.
        </p>

        <h2>1. What we collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Contact details</strong> you provide voluntarily — such as your name, phone number, email address, location and enquiry details — when you submit the contact form, message us on WhatsApp, or reach out via social media;</li>
          <li><strong>Property preferences</strong> you share with us — such as budget, preferred area, and whether you are buying for own stay or investment;</li>
          <li><strong>Basic usage data</strong> — if analytics tools (such as Google Analytics or Meta Pixel) are enabled, they may collect anonymised information about how visitors use this site (pages viewed, device type, approximate location). These tools use cookies or similar technologies.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How we use your data</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your enquiry and provide property advisory services — including shortlisting projects, arranging viewings, and assisting with bookings and follow-up;</li>
          <li>To share relevant property information or market updates with you, where you have asked for them;</li>
          <li>To improve this website and our services.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent or trade your personal data to third parties for
          marketing purposes.
        </p>

        <h2>3. When we share your data</h2>
        <p>Your data may be shared only where necessary to serve your enquiry — for example:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>With <strong>property developers</strong> when you register interest in or book a specific project;</li>
          <li>With <strong>banks or loan officers</strong> when you ask for financing assistance;</li>
          <li>With <strong>lawyers</strong> handling your Sale and Purchase Agreement;</li>
          <li>Where required by law, regulation or a competent authority.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          We keep personal data only for as long as needed for the purposes above, or as required
          by law and by the record-keeping standards applicable to registered estate negotiators.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Your rights under the PDPA</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Request access to the personal data we hold about you;</li>
          <li>Request correction of inaccurate or outdated data;</li>
          <li>Withdraw consent to further contact at any time — just tell us via WhatsApp or email and we will stop.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>6. Third-party links</h2>
        <p>
          This site links out to third-party platforms (WhatsApp, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube,
          Xiaohongshu, developer listing pages). Their privacy practices are governed by their own
          policies, which we encourage you to review.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For any privacy-related request, contact:
          <br />Lawrence Law ({SITE.renNumber})
          <br />WhatsApp: +6019-9939 860
          <br />Email: {SITE.email}
          <br />Address: {SITE.address}
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-10 text-xs text-ink/50">
        This policy was drafted for Lawrence Law Property's website. It is general information, not
        legal advice — have a lawyer review it before relying on it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
